WEBVTT

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:08.720
<i>The year that Glenn Litbeit spent with 
Saphentite Neikes left a huge impact on him.</i>

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:15.660
<i>Glenn became very interested 
in monsters and how they lived,</i>

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:20.140
<i>and would eventually be the first 
human to live in a monster dorm.</i>

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:25.260
Hello... I'm starting here today. 
My name is Glenn Litbeit.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.030
<i>It was an unexpected reunion.</i>

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>A few years later, the two of them 
would leave Cthulhy Squele's tutelage</i>

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.280
<i>and open up the Litbeit Clinic.</i>

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:41.590
<i>However...</i>

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:46.050
It appears that I've become pregnant.

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:58.250
<b>Monster Girl Doctor</b>

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:20.860
Case 4  The Lamia With an Incurable Disease

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:25.370
But that's impossible, Sapphee.

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:28.960
How could you be pregnant? 
Lamias are oviparous.

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:29.940
Oh, my.

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:31.570
Here, let me take a look.

00:02:31.570 --> 00:02:32.840
What the heck is in there?

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:35.030
Doctor! How could you 
ask me to strip like that?

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:36.130
I didn't.

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:45.600
An egg?

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:50.430
My friend found it on a street corner, 
of all places, and brought it here.

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:54.770
I couldn't just leave it be, 
so I decided to warm it a little.

00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:57.320
But this egg is unfertilized.

00:02:57.650 --> 00:03:00.450
A female harpy must've just ovulated.

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:04.580
What's wrong?

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:06.700
Outside! People!

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:07.700
Lots of them.

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:31.490
Breaking into our clinic at night?

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:34.760
They must not have known 
that a lamia was there.

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:37.360
Thanks, Sapphee. But who were they?

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:41.040
Given that they clearly didn't 
case out the place beforehand,

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:45.620
they probably saw you with Miss Kunai 
and thought you worked with her.

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:50.100
Meaning they're the slavers 
that were after Miss Kunai?

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:54.130
Yes. They might've been 
planning to take you hostage.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:58.080
As if I'd ever let that happen.

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:01.640
S-Sapphee, take it easy.

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:05.660
I guess we won't be able to 
return to the clinic tonight.

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:07.410
Let's head to the Central Council.

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:09.410
I'm sure if we explain 
everything to Miss Kunai...

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:10.980
That will not be necessary.

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:16.330
Miss Kunai!

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:20.870
I heard from the patrols that some 
of these guys headed to the clinic.

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:22.530
Glad to see you're safe.

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:27.320
So they're...

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:30.350
Yes. They're the slavers we've been after.

00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:33.550
They've been illegally trafficking harpies.

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:36.110
Illegally trafficking?

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:36.910
Yes.

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:40.420
They force the harpies 
they've kidnapped to lay eggs,

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:43.830
and sell them to humans 
with questionable tastes.

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:45.340
How awful...

00:04:46.190 --> 00:04:47.840
In that case...

00:04:48.230 --> 00:04:49.850
Is this one of theirs, too?

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:52.830
I'm certain it is.

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:55.480
Once they catch on, they'll come after you.

00:04:57.800 --> 00:05:01.520
Miss Kunai, we wish to request protection.

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:03.440
Would it be possible to commission 
the Council's patrols—

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:05.670
No, unfortunately...

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:08.000
That's out of the question!

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:18.780
Come to the Waterways with me.

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:24.050
So you're running a huge operation 
to expose the slavers tonight,

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:27.430
and most of the patrols are 
already working on that?

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:31.720
Correct. Therefore, we don't have 
anyone who can protect you.

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:35.220
Which would mean that staying 
with me would be your safest bet.

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:39.330
Yes, but having us infiltrate 
the enemy's hideout with you?

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:42.360
Need I remind you that we're civilians?

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:45.290
Realistically, this is the best solution.

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:46.090
Yes, but...

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:48.830
Wait, are you guys coming, 
too, Doctor Glenn?

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:53.710
Lulala? What are you doing here?

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:56.470
I'll explain on the way. Just get in.

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:06.010
Lady Skadi.

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.850
All righty, here we go!

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:23.410
Lady Skadi, why is Lulala towing this boat?

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:30.280
Lady Draconness says it 
was part of the deal.

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:33.750
In exchange for giving Lulala permission 
to sing at the Central Council Hall,

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:37.940
she will be helping us out from 
time to time on missions.

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:42.030
So you're telling me that you 
took advantage of her poverty.

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:43.670
How dare you, Dr. Glenn?!

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:45.680
I'm talking to Lady Skadi right now!

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:56.230
She says that she won't deny that.

00:06:57.820 --> 00:07:01.720
But it's true that Lulala 
was perfect for this job.

00:07:02.170 --> 00:07:04.870
Since she's regularly at 
the Central Council Hall,

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:07.530
it's only natural that she would 
come into contact with us.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:12.960
This is why our numerous meetings regarding 
these attacks went unnoticed by the bandits.

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:16.140
She is being rewarded handsomely.

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:18.660
I'm certain Lulala herself is
 satisfied with these conditions.

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:23.520
But Miss Lulala is still a young girl, 
and she's just gotten over being sick!

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:26.080
As her doctor, I can't allow her to 
take part in such dangerous mis—

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:28.390
Hey, why are you being so hostile about this?

00:07:28.390 --> 00:07:32.110
I appreciate your concern for me, 
but like Miss Kunai said,

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:34.730
I agreed to help out with this job.

00:07:34.730 --> 00:07:38.140
And Lady Skadi said I can swim 
outta there if things get dangerous.

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:38.930
But...

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:43.650
Anyway, I'm not a kid, so I'll decide 
which jobs I wanna do myself!

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:50.140
All right, Lulala. If you insist so 
vehemently, I'm in no place to object.

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:53.410
Right? You catch on quick, Doc.

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:57.060
Okay, I'm gonna pick up the pace a bit!

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:57.950
<b>Monster Girl Doctor</b>

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:04.080
The slavers' hideout is located on an 
old piece of land in the Waterways.

00:08:04.490 --> 00:08:09.330
We made huge underwater renovations to 
make it more optimal for the water monsters,

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:11.850
but most of the area above 
water remained untouched.

00:08:11.850 --> 00:08:13.630
That's where they found an opening.

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:18.530
Lady Draconness also regrets that oversight.

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:21.010
But that all ends today.

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:25.510
That's why I had you reattach my limbs.

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:28.640
How do you plan to infiltrate their hideout?

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:30.150
The patrols are involved, aren't they?

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:33.160
They've all been stationed already.

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:36.530
The patrols will charge from the front 
entrance to expose the hideout.

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:40.160
We will take advantage of that and 
infiltrate their hideout from the back.

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:44.150
Our plan is to save the 
kidnapped harpy girls.

00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:45.920
I understand,

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:51.360
but for you to involve Dr. Glenn and 
Lulala in something so dangerous...

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:57.960
<i>Did she just say, "I'm sorry"?</i>

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:03.460
Once we go under that bridge, 
we'll be near our destination.

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:06.540
It's finally time.

00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:12.610
Duck!

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:17.070
Arrows?!

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:18.780
Keep your head down!

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:27.570
Miss Kunai!

00:09:27.570 --> 00:09:29.760
Don't worry. I feel no pain.

00:09:29.760 --> 00:09:31.690
Yes, but if this keeps up—

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:37.120
You seem to be in quite 
the predicament, Doctor!

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:42.610
Honestly, I went all the way to the clinic 
to set a date for our betrothal,

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:45.180
and it had clearly been ransacked by ruffians!

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:47.900
I followed in pursuit only to find 
bandits armed with bows and arrows.

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:52.480
I would bring shame upon the noble name 
of Scythia if I did not wield my lance!

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:53.750
Miss Tisalia!

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:54.740
Could you talk any longer?!

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:57.750
Also, your betrothal is on infinite hiatus!

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:08.860
We shall take care of them.

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:11.710
Please go forth, everyone.

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:12.990
Thank you very much.

00:10:12.990 --> 00:10:14.480
Please stay safe.

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:19.140
That crest belongs to Scythia.

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:22.500
Centaurs are basically monster mercenaries.

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:25.480
I'm being kind when I call 
the Scythias warmongers.

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:29.110
As fellow mercenaries, I ask 
that you not get in our way.

00:10:29.110 --> 00:10:32.470
You could hardly survive 
without war yourselves.

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:36.730
Humans and monsters should 
never live alongside each other.

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:39.000
It's nothing but a fantasy!

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:43.340
Humans and monsters are meant to 
hate, fight, and kill each other!

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:45.370
Isn't that right, Scythia?

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:49.400
Have you lot been blind the whole 
time you've been in Lindworm?

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:50.130
What?

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:53.340
I'm asking what you could 
have possibly seen in this city

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:55.630
where humans and monsters 
live alongside one another!

00:10:56.370 --> 00:10:58.290
They've transcended race 
to support one another,

00:10:58.290 --> 00:11:00.530
acknowledge one another, 
and help one another.

00:11:00.530 --> 00:11:05.560
You are the one who is clearly living in a 
fantasy when facing the truth of this city!

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:08.230
Silence! We are proud mercenaries—

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:11.710
Then you should hurry and get rid 
of that filth you call pride!

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:13.390
You stupid horse!

00:11:22.790 --> 00:11:26.690
That's one ruffian down.

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:29.680
Lulala, we'll take care of the rest.

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:31.130
You may flee now.

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:34.750
Okay... You guys be careful, 'kay?

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.600
Thanks, Lulala.

00:11:38.930 --> 00:11:40.470
All right, let's go.

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:49.240
So you showed up after all. 
I guess bad feelings are accurate sometimes.

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:53.330
You guys should've made a run for it earlier.

00:11:55.530 --> 00:11:58.080
I assume you're the ringleader of the slavers.

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:00.640
Can't say I remember ever handling any slaves.

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:05.000
We were only buying and selling monster eggs.

00:12:06.930 --> 00:12:11.050
Unlawful occupation of the Waterways, 
kidnapping and imprisoning harpies,

00:12:11.050 --> 00:12:12.920
unlawful trading of eggs...

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:15.270
I have plenty of questions for you.

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:18.240
Well, there aren't any wars going on. 
What do you expect us to do?

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:23.020
As former mercenaries, we need to involve 
ourselves in some crimes to survive.

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:27.410
I'm sure the Council wouldn't mind hiring 
some of you to help out with construction.

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:31.430
Though, of course, your payment would 
be suited to criminals like yourselves.

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:34.470
What a stupid joke!

00:12:41.550 --> 00:12:42.410
Lady Draconness!

00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:44.500
This is your chance to get to the girls!

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:47.360
Be careful, Miss Kunai!

00:12:47.360 --> 00:12:48.160
Don't worry about me!

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:50.740
You sure you want to let

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:53.910
Lady Draconness, the one you're 
supposed to protect, go on without you?

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:56.930
I've got plenty of my men waiting in there.

00:12:56.930 --> 00:13:01.660
You fool. I can't compare to 
Lady Draconness's strength.

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:03.930
Besides, right about now...

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:05.180
Charge!

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:27.070
Is this it?

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:39.460
They're here, Doctor.

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:48.820
Good evening. Please don't be afraid.

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:51.310
We're from the Litbeit Clinic.

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:53.800
You're a doctor?

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:55.880
You came to save us?

00:13:55.880 --> 00:13:58.140
Yes. You're safe now.

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:03.620
<i>This place is cleaner than I expected.</i>

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:07.390
<i>And since they're in the Waterways, 
they must've had a chance to bathe.</i>

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:12.350
<i>But their wings aren't getting enough oil, 
and it's clear that they've been losing feathers.</i>

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:14.570
<i>Their emotional distress must be tremendous.</i>

00:14:15.110 --> 00:14:16.440
<i>Poor things.</i>

00:14:16.440 --> 00:14:18.080
Um... Um, excuse me...

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:21.960
Her stomach has been hurting.

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:28.350
Sapphee, I need a light!

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:34.090
When did she start saying it hurt?

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:35.850
She hadn't been feeling well for a while,

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:38.940
but she only started suffering 
like this a little while ago.

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:42.720
Bite down on this.

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:48.010
I'm going to touch your stomach now.

00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:50.010
Please raise your hand if you feel any pain.

00:14:57.020 --> 00:14:59.390
<i>The distension in her abdomen feels hard.</i>

00:14:59.390 --> 00:15:01.530
<i>The cause isn't her bowels.</i>

00:15:01.530 --> 00:15:02.630
<i>Which means...</i>

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:04.940
Doctor, what's causing this?

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:08.180
This is egg binding caused by excessive stress.

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:12.150
It's a condition in which eggs 
get stuck in the oviduct.

00:15:12.150 --> 00:15:15.630
It's extremely painful, too. We need 
to take care of it immediately,

00:15:15.630 --> 00:15:17.510
before the worst happens.

00:15:18.260 --> 00:15:20.390
We'll treat her here.

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:23.210
Sapphee, you and Lady Skadi keep an eye out.

00:15:23.210 --> 00:15:24.770
All right.

00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:31.190
I'm now going to massage your abdomen.

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:35.440
Don't worry. Your body is ready to lay eggs.

00:15:35.440 --> 00:15:37.020
Stay calm.

00:15:47.850 --> 00:15:50.060
Breathe in... and out.

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:53.900
Slowly... Yes, and relax.

00:15:57.420 --> 00:15:59.870
Doctor! There are bandits outside!

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:10.300
<i>Dr. Glenn, there are two things 
that I'm keeping secret from you.</i>

00:16:12.440 --> 00:16:18.620
<i>The first is that I have an incurable 
illness that no one can treat.</i>

00:16:21.050 --> 00:16:22.870
<i>And the other</i>

00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:27.510
<i>is about my lineage.</i>

00:16:30.230 --> 00:16:34.980
<i>For generations, the Neikes clan 
specialized not only in pharmaceuticals,</i>

00:16:34.980 --> 00:16:39.630
<i>but also in poisons, as well as 
assassination techniques.</i>

00:16:41.740 --> 00:16:44.970
If the negotiations with 
the humans fall through,

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:48.490
you must be the one who 
slays the Litbeit family.

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:51.270
I trust that you are up 
to the task, Saphentite.

00:16:51.270 --> 00:16:53.200
Yes, Mother.

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:56.740
<i>Thankfully, that never happened,</i>

00:16:56.740 --> 00:17:01.340
<i>but if it had... would I have 
been able to slay the Litbeits?</i>

00:17:01.340 --> 00:17:05.090
<i>Would I have been able to kill Dr. Glenn?</i>

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:17.550
<i>After meeting you, I contracted 
this incurable illness.</i>

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:27.320
<i>Oh, no... It was poisoned.</i>

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:35.290
<i>This isn't good... My tongue is going numb.</i>

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:37.030
<i>Doctor...</i>

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:41.040
<i>Run. Please, run.</i>

00:17:42.530 --> 00:17:45.280
<i>Doctor... Dr. Glenn...</i>

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:48.250
<i>Even in times like this...</i>

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:50.390
<i>You're so wonderful.</i>

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:54.020
Sapphee?

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:56.660
Sapphee! Sapphee!

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:05.950
Thank goodness. You gave me a scare 
when you didn't wake up immediately.

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:09.890
Doctor... Where am I?

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:12.320
The Council let us use one of their rooms.

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:18.070
Doctor, the poison...

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:20.970
It was a paralyzing 
poison from a mandragora.

00:18:20.970 --> 00:18:24.890
That amount would've been fatal for 
a human, but has little effect on lamias.

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:26.680
At most, it'd put you to sleep.

00:18:27.260 --> 00:18:28.830
You knew?

00:18:29.220 --> 00:18:33.220
If I didn't, there's no way I'd leave 
you alone while I treated that girl.

00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:35.920
You could tell what kind of 
poison it was just by looking?

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:39.830
They weren't expecting to fight a lamia.

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:42.730
There aren't many poisons 
that work on lamias.

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:45.280
I know I lose sight of things 
when I'm treating a patient,

00:18:45.280 --> 00:18:47.560
but I'm not <i>that</i> oblivious.

00:18:51.950 --> 00:18:55.870
All of the slavers have been arrested. 
Everyone else is safe.

00:18:56.700 --> 00:19:01.500
And that harpy girl was able to 
safely lay her egg right after.

00:19:03.340 --> 00:19:06.630
Thankfully, her oviduct was just fine, too.

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:10.070
I'm glad to hear that.

00:19:12.590 --> 00:19:20.320
Doctor, if you noticed the poison, 
you must've also noticed how I was fighting.

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:21.810
Yeah, sure...

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:25.550
I've kept this a secret from you,

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:28.370
but for generations, the Neikes clan...

00:19:28.370 --> 00:19:29.680
worked as assassins...

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:31.360
Yup, I know.

00:19:31.360 --> 00:19:32.450
Say what?!

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:38.060
When you came to our house as a hostage, 
even I knew you'd been given orders like that.

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:43.680
My father researched everything about the 
Neikes clan before going into negotiations.

00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:48.290
Th-That was supposed to be one of 
the biggest confessions of my life...

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:52.310
And there were members of my 
family who had the same idea.

00:19:52.310 --> 00:19:55.780
Remember that one time you'd gotten a fever?

00:19:55.780 --> 00:20:01.680
Y-Yes... It was my first time living 
among humans, so I fell ill...

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:06.380
I'm really sorry. One of the servants 
poisoned your food without telling us.

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:10.300
They apparently did it to tip 
the negotiations in our favor.

00:20:10.880 --> 00:20:16.530
Thinking back, that might've been my first 
experience with the field of medicine.

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:20.660
I wanted to do everything 
I could to make you better.

00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:25.660
Doctor... So you knew everything...

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:29.690
If you hadn't been there, I wouldn't have 
been able to save that harpy girl, either.

00:20:29.690 --> 00:20:33.450
It might be weird to say this, 
but I'm always grateful for you.

00:20:33.450 --> 00:20:34.540
Doctor!

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:39.550
Uh, Sapphee...

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:45.280
There's no way I can hold back 
after you said all of that!

00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:47.840
I mean, I appreciate the thought, 
but you're being too forceful!

00:20:47.840 --> 00:20:50.820
Well, I've always been like this, so...

00:20:50.820 --> 00:20:56.020
Wait, no! If Dr. Cthulhy finds out, you won't 
be able to stay at the clinic anymore!

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:58.870
Then let's just run away together.

00:20:58.870 --> 00:21:01.770
Yes, we can leave Lindworm and go wherever.

00:21:00.810 --> 00:21:02.730
Wait, your eyes are all glazed over!

00:21:02.730 --> 00:21:05.910
It's all right. Tonight, we can...

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:14.110
The poison's not completely out of your system. 
You shouldn't overexert yourself.

00:21:14.110 --> 00:21:15.820
'Kay...

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:20.240
You don't need to worry about it anymore.

00:21:20.240 --> 00:21:22.110
Just rest until morning.

00:21:22.110 --> 00:21:23.590
O-Okay...

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:30.330
Doctor, may I ask you for a favor?

00:21:30.770 --> 00:21:31.730
What is it?

00:21:32.210 --> 00:21:34.270
Could you hold on to my tail?

00:21:34.950 --> 00:21:37.480
Just until I fall asleep would suffice.

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:39.190
Sure, of course.

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:48.140
Your hand is so warm... It's very soothing...

00:21:49.270 --> 00:21:50.400
Glenn.

00:21:51.050 --> 00:21:55.400
<i>The incurable disease that has 
befallen me, Saphentite Neikes,</i>

00:21:55.400 --> 00:21:57.110
<i>won't be cured any time soon.</i>

00:21:58.050 --> 00:22:00.000
<i>Yes. Because I met him...</i>

00:22:00.780 --> 00:22:04.940
<i>I met Glenn Litbeit.</i>

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.930
Case 5          The Centaur With a Sprain

00:23:35.520 --> 00:23:39.380
Case 5: "The Centaur With a Sprain."
